  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_2626.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este viernes ha abierto sus puertas Raval Gin&amp;Tap, en la recientemente remodelada plaza del mismo nombre en Onda. Su especialidad ser&aacute;n las tapas elaboradas y novedosas, y los combinados con t&oacute;nicas y ginebras de alta gama.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2623.jpg\" alt=\"img_2623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2624.jpg\" alt=\"img_2624\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2625.jpg\" alt=\"img_2625\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2626.jpg\" alt=\"img_2626\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2627.jpg\" alt=\"img_2627\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2628.jpg\" alt=\"img_2628\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2629.jpg\" alt=\"img_2629\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2630.jpg\" alt=\"img_2630\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2631.jpg\" alt=\"img_2631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugravalgintap/img_2632.jpg\" alt=\"img_2632\" style=\"max-